  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "村西の借金の肩代わりだ  (Shouldering Muranishi's Debt)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "fujiwara": "藤原",
    "student": "生徒",
    "toshi": "トシ"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After Muranishi escapes, Furuya's deputy storms into Kawada's studio with his men, ransacking the safe, seizing their new master tapes, and announcing that the crew must shoulder Muranishi's entire two-billion-yen debt.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おい荻原！関係ねえだろ、出てけよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "やめてもらっていいですか！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "おい、何か金になりそうな物ねえのか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "てめえよ、女に手出すな！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "お前親まだ生きてる？生きてるんだったら呼んでこい、今すぐ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "荻原、てめえやめろよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "村西の借金の肩代わりだ、お前ら全員でな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "しかたねえだろ。村西はお前らのこと売って飛んだんだからよ。俺たちも困ってんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "全部で二十億、ちゃんと返してくれよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "今日これもらってくわ。じゃあまた明日な。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "見つけたら俺のとこ持ってこい。村西見なかったか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "乗れよ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おい荻原！関係ねえだろ、出てけよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey! We have nothing to do with this—get out!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "やめてもらっていいですか！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Could you please stop doing that?!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "おい、何か金になりそうな物ねえのか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, isn't there anything around here we can turn into cash?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "てめえよ、女に手出すな！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Damn you—keep your hands off the women!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "お前親まだ生きてる？生きてるんだったら呼んでこい、今すぐ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are your parents still alive? If they are, call them down here right this second.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "荻原、てめえやめろよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Damn it, knock it off!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "村西の借金の肩代わりだ、お前ら全員でな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are taking over Muranishi's debt—every single one of you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "しかたねえだろ。村西はお前らのこと売って飛んだんだからよ。俺たちも困ってんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We have no choice. Muranishi sold you guys out and skipped town, so we're in a bind too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "全部で二十億、ちゃんと返してくれよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Two billion in total—make sure you pay every yen back.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "今日これもらってくわ。じゃあまた明日な。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We'll take these tapes for today. See you again tomorrow.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "見つけたら俺のとこ持ってこい。村西見なかったか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When you find him, bring him straight to me. Have you seen Muranishi?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "乗れよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Get in.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
